10: ['A Brother’s Shadow','Speak with Mara at the telegraph office.','Mara Bell','The wire went dead three nights ago. Thomas was sending from the north line. Sheriff Vale told me to forget I ever heard his name. I don’t forget things, Daniel.'],
11: ['A Quiet Ledger','Search the sheriff’s office for Thomas’s arrest record.','Mara Bell','Vale keeps a second ledger in his desk. The front door is watched. Try the back, and keep your head down.'],
12: ['Dust on the Trail','Ride to Mercer Ranch and ask old Silas about the riders.','Silas Mercer','Four riders came through before dawn. One wore a brass spur stamped with a coiled snake. Thomas had the same mark burned into a letter.'],
13: ['The Brass Spur','Follow the tracks to the dry creek bed.','Silas Mercer','If they rode north, the wash will show it. Take your iron. The country’s gone mean.'],
14: ['A Camp Gone Cold','Clear the outlaw camp and search their supplies.','Silas Mercer','A gang calling itself the Ash Vipers. They’re new to this county, but someone gave them a map.'],
15: ['No Easy Answers','Return to Mara with the map you found.','Mara Bell','This is a survey of Bellweather Mine. Thomas thought the owners were moving something through the old workings.'],
16: ['Bellweather','Reach the abandoned mine before sundown.','Mara Bell','There’s a service entrance east of the ridge. I’ll wait here. If you find him, bring him home.'],
17: ['Below the Ridge','Search the mine office for the missing dispatch.','Mara Bell','The mine closed ten years ago. Why is the telegraph still running? Someone’s been using that tunnel.'],
18: ['The Company Man','Confront foreman Harlan at the mine entrance.','Harlan Rusk','Your brother asked the wrong questions. The railroad men paid good money to keep those questions quiet.'],
19: ['A Long Ride','Take the dispatch to Fort Carden.','Harlan Rusk','Captain Reddick signed the transport orders. He’s at the fort, east of the river.'],
20: ['Fort Carden','Speak with Captain Reddick at the garrison.','Captain Reddick','I signed no such order. But that seal is real. Someone in my office is selling military routes.'],
21: ['A Familiar Face','Find the quartermaster after dark.','Captain Reddick','Quartermaster Dole has been here twenty years. He knows every supply wagon and every name on the rolls.'],
22: ['The False Trail','Ride to Red Wash and intercept the supply wagon.','Captain Reddick','Dole’s wagon leaves at first light. Don’t let it reach the canyon.'],
23: ['Snake in the Grass','Bring the quartermaster to justice.','Captain Reddick','Dole has friends in the Ash Vipers. Be careful who you point that revolver at.'],
24: ['A Brother’s Mark','Search the canyon hideout for Thomas’s journal.','Mara Bell','He left a mark on the canyon wall when we were children. Three scratches beneath the hawk. Look for it.'],
25: ['The Empty Saddle','Ask rancher June about the rider seen heading west.','June Calder','A man matching Thomas’s description bought a fresh horse here. He wasn’t alone. He looked scared.'],
26: ['Last Telegraph','Restore the relay at Pine Ridge station.','June Calder','The line runs through the forest now. If the relay works, Mara can trace the last signal.'],
27: ['The Crossing','Defend the river crossing until the riders arrive.','Mara Bell','The message is clear: Thomas is alive. But the Vipers know we’re close. Hold the crossing.'],
28: ['What Was Buried','Meet Thomas at the old church beyond the cemetery.','Thomas Mercer','Danny. I’m sorry. There’s something you need to know about Father, and the land deed he hid.'],
29: ['A New Horizon','Decide what becomes of the Mercer land and the people who live on it.','Thomas Mercer','Whatever comes next, we face it together. No more running from the truth.']
